        "titolo_orig": "'Extremely positive and productive talks': Trump praises Xi meeting",
        "testo_it": "Donald Trump elogia l'esito dei colloqui avuti a Pechino con il leader cinese Xi Jinping.",
        "priorita": "Alta",
        "id_gruppo": 3,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/extremely-positive-and-productive-talks-trump-praises-xi-meeting",
        "orario": "18:20",
        "timestamp": 1778775627,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. 'Extremely positive and productive talks': Trump praises Xi meeting Asia / Pacific Issued on: 14/05/2026 - 18:20 Chinese President Xi Jinping warned his US counterpart Donald Trump that missteps on Taiwan could push their two countries into \"conflict\", a stark opening salvo as they met in Beijing on Thursday for a two-day summit. The Chinese Foreign ministry said the comments came in a closed-door meeting that lasted more than two hours. It was followed by a friendlier, opulent banquet during which Trump and Xi stressed the importance of working together. Story by Carys Garland. US-China priority is 'economic relationship': Trump 'heavily prioritising trade and investment' 14/05/2026 china \"Conflict\" possible: Xi Jinping issues Taiwan warning during Donald Trump's visit 14/05/2026 Asia / Pacific China or the US: Who has the largest army? 14/05/2026 Asia / Pacific What did Trump and Xi discuss at high-profile Beijing summit? 14/05/2026 Asia / Pacific Taiwan says China 'sole risk' to peace after Xi warned Trump over Taiwan issue 14/05/2026 Asia / Pacific Donald Trump and Xi Jinping hold high-stakes meeting in Beijing 14/05/2026 Asia / Pacific Taiwan vs China: Is conflict inevitable? 13/05/2026 Asia / Pacific Trump arrives in China for historic trip 13/05/2026 Asia / Pacific Trump 'could choose to change Taiwan policy in Beijing' unhindered by Congress, analyst says 12/05/2026 Asia / Pacific"
